From a814fc5ba5f5ee6f3810150a02b998899e8db26c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nathan Singh <nathan.singh@hotmail.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 09:49:05 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Arena: a class viewer, taught by a scholar in the upper hall

A scholar (the elder's sprite 0x6f, which the hall already loads: no extra
sprite memory) stands at (56, 168) in the upper hall, a new row after the scout
in both placement tables (ACTOR_CLASS_VIEWER) and a talk trigger to
BattleArena_ClassViewer (scene/arena_menu.c). It loops the party manager's
member picker (status panel) and ClassViewer_Run, a new part of shop.c
(shop/shop/arena_class_viewer.c, far call ClassViewer_RunFar, import row).

ClassViewer_Run has two windows over the screen, a 30 by 11 panel and a 30 by 9
list. The browse screen shows a line of classes (twenty lines: the class ids
that share a tens digit and have a series 1 to 10), L and R change the line,
the hand highlights a class and the panel shows its name, the Djinn it needs
for this character (ceil((required * 10 - elementBonus) / 10) of each element,
as animated Djinn figures with a count), HP, PP, Attack, Defense, Agility and
Luck as percentages of the base stat, the ward, and whether the party's Djinn
reach it. Select toggles Now (classes whose needs the Djinn held by the whole
party, set or on standby, cover) and All (red names are not reachable now); A
opens the class's Psynergy, eight to a page, an icon for what the character's
level has and a red level for what it has not, with PP and the level in the
window under; B goes back. Labels are 19 new messages above the generated cups
block (gen-cups.py re-run).

The shop bank (rom_main_06) overflowed by 0x81d bytes, so main.ld moves the
start of bank 07 to 0x080b7000 and bank 08 to 0x080c9d00 (tbs-en only; bank 07
ends at 0x080c9c6c, bank 08 before 0x080f0000).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
